[gd_resource type="Resource" format=3]

; Recipe Book — "Edda's Warband Pattern"
; A single sheet of vellum with charcoal-rubbed axe-head outlines, taken from
; warband heads recovered on the Whisperwood road. Edda hands it over after the player
; brings her one intact axe-head plus an honest day's hammer-work at the forge.
; In-world look: charred edge, ash-smudged finger-marks, a single ink note in Edda's hand.

